=== Restaurant Rush (Stage 3) ===
Customer arrival seed: 24369
You are the manager. Each turn: customers arrive -> Happy Hour decision -> Host task -> you choose the Waiter task -> you choose
the Chef task -> served customers eat -> the Cashier collects one payment automatically ->
everyone not yet served loses satisfaction.
Waiting loss: Regular 8, VIP 5, Critic 12. VIP bills are 10% off.
Stage 3: turn-start Happy Hour decision -> Host -> Waiter -> Chef -> automatic steps.
Regular/VIP choices cycle through the three dishes, then the three combos by customer ID.
Happy Hour: once per game, two turns, 20% off new orders after VIP discount;
waiting customers recover 15 satisfaction at each active turn start, capped at 100.
Critics choose the dish with the most preparation units (first menu item breaks ties).
Goal after turn 18: at least 4 paid customers, revenue at least $45.00, average satisfaction at least 60.

Menu (customers choose their own food):
  Salad  $9.00  1 prep unit(s)
  Burger  $15.00  1 prep unit(s)
  Pasta  $18.00  2 prep unit(s)
  Salad + Burger Combo  $21.60  2 prep unit(s)
  Salad + Pasta Combo  $24.30  3 prep unit(s)
  Burger + Pasta Combo  $29.70  3 prep unit(s)

